After a week of heavy cooking, the stove knobs feel tacky, the chimney mesh looks tar-black, and the cabinet above the hob has a faint yellow haze. Degrease the hob and backsplash while warm-not-hot, soak and scrub the chimney filter mesh, wipe cabinet fronts with the right cleaner, and improve ventilation.
